OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and cloudy morning,
OL,6,Fturning unsettled as rain moves in
OL,7,Ffrom the west, with some heavy and
OL,8,Fblustery outbreaks possible by the
OL,9,Fevening. The wind gradually
OL,10,Fstrengthens throughout the morning,
OL,11,Fbecoming strong by the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA wet and windy start to the
OL,14,Fnight. Clear spells follow the rain,
OL,15,Fwith a few showers possible, but most
OL,16,Fplaces will stay dry. Remaining windy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
