OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FStrong winds continue, with
OL,6,Fsunshine and showers. Heavier showers
OL,7,Fare likely across northern parts, and
OL,8,Fgale-force winds, or stronger, across
OL,9,Fhigh ground and along the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FStaying unsettled over the coming
OL,13,Fdays, with bands of rain followed by
OL,14,Fshowers and windy conditions at times.
OL,15,FSettling down later Wednesday as the
OL,16,Fwind eases and showers clear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
